    {
      "type": "grammar",
      "id": "u25.d04.grammar",
      "title": {
        "en": "a few / a little / most / none",
        "ru": "a few / a little / most / none"
      },
      "rule": {
        "en": "\"a few\" + plural (some, positive), \"a little\" + uncountable (some). \"few/little\" (without \"a\") means \"almost none\". \"most\" = the majority, \"none\" = not any.",
        "ru": "«a few» + мн. число (немного, положительно), «a little» + неисчисляемое (немного). «few/little» (без «a») = «почти нет». «most» = большинство, «none» = ни одного."
      },
      "patterns": [
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "a few / a little",
            "ru": "a few / a little"
          },
          "formula": "a few + plural · a little + uncountable",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "a few apples · a little milk",
              "ru": "несколько яблок · немного молока"
            }
          ],
          "ref": "quantifiers-b1"
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "few / little (almost none)",
            "ru": "few / little (почти нет)"
          },
          "formula": "few + plural · little + uncountable",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "Few people came. There's little time.",
              "ru": "Мало кто пришёл. Времени мало."
            }
          ],
          "ref": "quantifiers-b1"
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "most / none of",
            "ru": "most / none of"
          },
          "formula": "most (of) + noun · none of + noun",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "Most people agree. None of them came.",
              "ru": "Большинство согласны. Никто из них не пришёл."
            }
          ],
          "ref": "quantifiers-b1"
        }
      ],
      "pitfalls": [
        {
          "en": "\"a few\" = plural, \"a little\" = uncountable: \"a few eggs\", \"a little sugar\".",
          "ru": "«a few» = мн. число, «a little» = неисчисляемое: «a few eggs», «a little sugar»."
        },
        {
          "en": "\"few/little\" (no \"a\") is negative: \"few friends\" = almost no friends.",
          "ru": "«few/little» (без «a») отрицательно: «few friends» = почти нет друзей."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "reading",
      "id": "u25.d04.reading",
      "title": {
        "en": "A simple recipe",
        "ru": "Простой рецепт"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "u25.d04.reading.b1",
          "en": "This recipe needs only a few ingredients. You'll need a little flour, a couple of eggs, and some milk. Most people already have these at home. Add a little sugar and a few spices for flavour.",
          "ru": "Для этого рецепта нужно лишь несколько ингредиентов. Понадобится немного муки, пара яиц и молоко. У большинства людей это уже есть дома. Добавь немного сахара и пару специй для вкуса.",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u25.d04.reading.b1.mp3",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "u25.d04.reading.b2",
          "en": "Mix everything together. There's very little work involved, and it takes hardly any time. Most of the flavour comes from the fresh fruit on top. None of my friends can believe how easy it is — a few minutes and it's done!",
          "ru": "Смешай всё вместе. Работы совсем немного, и времени почти не нужно. Большая часть вкуса — от свежих фруктов сверху. Никто из моих друзей не верит, как это просто — пара минут, и готово!",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u25.d04.reading.b2.mp3",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "glossary": [
